 StandardForm_WithTabs;parms;n;globalParms
⍝ Presents a standard form with a status bar and three buttons, "OK", "Help" and "Close"
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'MyForm'
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size←200 400
 :EndIf
 parms.minSize←100 200
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.AddTabs n('Address' 'Turnover' 'Misc')
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.AddButtons n('OK' 'Help' 'Close')
 n.∆buttons.onSelect←1
 n.VersionNo.Text←1⊃##.APLGUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version

 n.∆Form.Wait
 n.∆CloseForm
⍝Done
